      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think i want to move away from just describing the sadness. i've been thinking about this idea that maybe the only way to truly capture a moment of total surrender... like, actually feeling the end of everything... is to make the art part of the act itself. like, how can you write about the ultimate release if you're still just standing on the sidelines watching it? does that even make sense?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
